---

- Keep the backend a NestJS modular monolith.
- Do not add AI, microservices, Redis, queues, object storage, or dashboards unless the active phase explicitly requires them.
- Keep collector workflows low-literacy, multilingual (English/Hindi/Marathi), and offline-first.
- Image-only analysis may report only visible condition. Never infer hidden internal hardware faults from a photograph.
- Treat payment and QR custody records as auditable, append-only business events.
